# READY. runtime data (e/gitignore): sessions carry entity states, logs,
# OAuth credentials and the personal runtime skill copy must never become
# trackable. The tracked skill library lives in resources/skills/. Runtime
# paths resolve against the elected config's directory (the runtime home),
# so an explicit --config at the repo root puts sessions/ and skills/ next
# to that config — i.e. right back under this .ready/ directory.
# legacy runtime dir name (the pre-.ready era; operator deletes by hand)
.home
.ready
